.TH "INSPEKT\-DESCRIBE" "1" "2026\-04\-16" "Inspekt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inspekt\-describe \- Generate an AI\-powered description of the page for
screen reader users.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]describe\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Generate an AI\-powered description of the page for screen reader users.
.PP
Extracts page structure (landmarks, headings, links, images, forms) and
uses AI to create a concise, natural description perfect for blind users
to understand what the page offers at a glance.
.PP
Returns a conversational description like: \(lqThis is a news article
page with a main navigation menu, 3 featured stories, and a sidebar with
recent posts\&...\(rq
.PP
Ideal for:
.IP \(bu 2
Screen reader users getting page orientation
.IP \(bu 2
Accessibility testing and auditing
.IP \(bu 2
Understanding complex page layouts
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\(enget\-url\f[R]
Output the inspekt:// URL instead of executing
.TP
\f[B]\(enlang\f[R], \f[I]TEXT\f[R]
Language for AI output (overrides config)
.TP
\f[B]\(endebug\f[R]
Show the full prompt instead of calling AI
.TP
\f[B]\(enforce\-refresh\f[R]
Force refresh, bypass cache
.TP
\f[B]\(enjson\f[R]
Output as JSON with metadata
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
.EX
inspekt describe
inspekt describe \-\-language en
inspekt describe \-\-json
.EE
